Source: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Mischa <mischa.siekmann@futureproofhomes.net>
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Build-Depends:
  debhelper-compat (= 13)
Homepage: https://github.com/futureproofhomes/Satellite1-RPi

Package: @PACKAGE_NAME@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends:
  ${misc:Depends}
Recommends:
  satellite1-rpi-sdk,
  flashrom
Description: XMOS firmware payload for Satellite1 devices
 Installs XMOS firmware artifacts and metadata under
 /usr/share/satellite1/firmware/xmos. This package does not automatically
 flash firmware during apt install.
